   "body_html": "I&#39;m getting the impression that the <i>intended</i> answer deals with things like <code>(char*)-1</code>, for which an implementation is <i>likely</i> to let <code>p&lt;(p+1)</code> evaluate to false, but that pointer constant is invalid in both C and in C++."
