   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "True, undefinedness propagates, and it doesn&#39;t even make much sense to discuss the comparison when you are already in UB-land from the arithmetic. My point was that comparisons on valid pointers don&#39;t give UB even when the pointers are otherwise unrelated (despite some claims to the contrary)."
